    "Apple 本机翻译不支持当前语言组合，请选择其他系统语言或切换到当前 AI 服务。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple On-Device Translation does not support the current language pair. Choose another system language or switch to the current AI service."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 本机翻译不支持当前语言组合，请选择其他系统语言或切换到当前 AI 服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 本机翻译不支持自定义目标语言，请选择系统预设语言或切换到当前 AI 服务。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
