    "Chrome 优先生成自包含 MHTML；Firefox 在大小上限内生成离线 HTML。应用未打开时，扩展会把待导入内容保留在浏览器本地队列，应用恢复后再重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome prefers self-contained MHTML, while Firefox creates offline HTML within the size limit. If the app is closed, the extension keeps pending imports in the browser-local queue and retries when the app is available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome 优先生成自包含 MHTML；Firefox 在大小上限内生成离线 HTML。应用未打开时，扩展会把待导入内容保留在浏览器本地队列，应用恢复后再重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome 和 Firefox 扩展独立安装和更新，均通过本机回环接口连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome and Firefox extensions are installed and updated separately; both connect through the local loopback interface."
