    "一键下线会核对远端版本、提交删除并清理本地 Markdown；PR/MR 模式会等待合并确认。可能被其他文章复用的图片不会自动删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One-step unpublish verifies the remote version, commits the deletion, and removes the local Markdown. In PR/MR mode, it waits for merge confirmation. Images that may be reused by other articles are not deleted automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一键下线会核对远端版本、提交删除并清理本地 Markdown；PR/MR 模式会等待合并确认。可能被其他文章复用的图片不会自动删除。"
          }
