    "先克隆主题仓库，再回到这里选择“导入已有站点”。导入会保留主题文件，不会把主题改造成 Starter。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clone the theme repository first, then return here and choose “Import Existing Site.” The import keeps the theme files intact and does not convert the theme into a starter."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先克隆主题仓库，再回到这里选择“导入已有站点”。导入会保留主题文件，不会把主题改造成 Starter。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先写本地 Markdown 草稿，不要求仓库、站点类型或发布配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with local Markdown drafts without configuring a repository, site type, or publishing settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先写本地 Markdown 草稿，不要求仓库、站点类型或发布配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先冻结并复核远端、分支、提交说明和精确文件清单；确认后会重新校验，再提交并推送。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First freeze and review the remote, branch, commit message, and exact file list. After confirmation, they are validated again before committing and pushing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先冻结并复核远端、分支、提交说明和精确文件清单；确认后会重新校验，再提交并推送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先分析内容，再确认导入。原始文件、图片与仓库都不会在预览阶段被改写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analyze the content before confirming the import. Source files, images, and the repository are not modified during preview."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先分析内容，再确认导入。原始文件、图片与仓库都不会在预览阶段被改写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先处理文章检查结果，再写入或线上发布。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resolve the article checks before writing files or publishing online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先处理文章检查结果，再写入或线上发布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先处理网站更新，再审阅这台 Mac 上的变化，确认后进入统一发布流程。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review website updates first, then changes on this Mac, and continue to the unified publishing flow."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先处理网站更新，再审阅这台 Mac 上的变化，确认后进入统一发布流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先处理错误；这些文章当前不能安全发布。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resolve errors first; these articles cannot be published safely yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先处理错误；这些文章当前不能安全发布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先处理阻止发布、最高风险与可自动修复项": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with publishing blockers, the highest risks, and AI-fixable items."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先处理阻止发布、最高风险与可自动修复项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先扫描本地仓库": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan the Local Repository First"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先扫描本地仓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先查看这些更新，避免覆盖其他设备或网站上的新内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review these updates first to avoid overwriting newer content from another device or the website."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先查看这些更新，避免覆盖其他设备或网站上的新内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先比较本地、远程和最终版本；只有点击“应用最终版本并暂存”后，才会写入工作区并执行 git add。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compare local, remote, and final versions first; changes are written to the workspace and staged with git add only after clicking \"Apply Final Version and Stage\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先比较本地、远程和最终版本；只有点击“应用最终版本并暂存”后，才会写入工作区并执行 git add。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
