          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会保存已勾选的内容；搜索索引在本机建立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会创建用户主动选择的脱敏 ZIP；不包含草稿正文、附件、API Key 或钥匙串内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only a redacted ZIP that you explicitly choose to create will be exported. It does not include draft text, attachments, API keys, or Keychain data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会创建用户主动选择的脱敏 ZIP；不包含草稿正文、附件、API Key 或钥匙串内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会删除已读、未加入稍后阅读且没有高亮的文章；此操作无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only read articles that are not in Read Later and have no highlights will be deleted. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会删除已读、未加入稍后阅读且没有高亮的文章；此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会删除当前部署平台的独立钥匙串项，不会删除仓库访问令牌。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the current deployment platform's separate Keychain item will be deleted. The repository access token will remain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会删除当前部署平台的独立钥匙串项，不会删除仓库访问令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会把尚未登记的本地文章加入工作台，不会改写仓库文件或覆盖已有草稿。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only local articles not yet registered are added to the workbench; repository files are not rewritten and existing drafts are not overwritten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会把尚未登记的本地文章加入工作台，不会改写仓库文件或覆盖已有草稿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会清理超过保留期限、已读、未加入稍后阅读且没有高亮的文章；稍后阅读文章和批注不会被误删。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only read articles beyond the retention period that are not saved for later and have no highlights are removed. Saved articles and annotations are preserved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会清理超过保留期限、已读、未加入稍后阅读且没有高亮的文章；稍后阅读文章和批注不会被误删。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只保存 RSS 或 Atom 实际返回的摘要和正文 HTML；不会抓取原网页缺失的全文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saves only the summary and body HTML returned by RSS or Atom; it does not fetch full text missing from the original feed response."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只保存 RSS 或 Atom 实际返回的摘要和正文 HTML；不会抓取原网页缺失的全文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只保存在应用内存中，退出 RepoPress Studio 后自动清除，不写配置文件或钥匙串。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep the key only in app memory. It is cleared when RepoPress Studio quits and is not written to a configuration file or Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只保存在应用内存中，退出 RepoPress Studio 后自动清除，不写配置文件或钥匙串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只准备最终内容，不会写入或暂存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only prepares the final content; it does not write or stage changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只准备最终内容，不会写入或暂存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只同步当前网站草稿到远端；不会纳入批量正式发布，也不会移除 draft 标记。请确认远端、分支和完整文件清单。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Syncs only the current website draft to the remote repository. It is excluded from formal batch publishing and keeps its draft marker. Confirm the remote, branch, and complete file list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只同步当前网站草稿到远端；不会纳入批量正式发布，也不会移除 draft 标记。请确认远端、分支和完整文件清单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在本机使用 Vision OCR；不会上传原图。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses Vision OCR only on this Mac; the original image is never uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只在本机使用 Vision OCR；不会上传原图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只显示 .html / .htm": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Showing .html / .htm only"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只显示 .html / .htm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只显示当前阻断与文件变更": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows only the current blocker and file changes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只显示当前阻断与文件变更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只更新工作台中的草稿归属，不会改写原仓库文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updates draft ownership in the workspace only; original repository files are not rewritten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只更新工作台中的草稿归属，不会改写原仓库文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只更新站点文件，不提交到 Git，也不会上传到网站。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updates site files only. Does not commit to Git or upload to the website."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只更新站点文件，不提交到 Git，也不会上传到网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有勾选的「新增」和「更新」项会被应用；相同文章和冲突项不会改写本地草稿。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only selected New and Update items are applied. Identical and conflicting articles do not modify local drafts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有勾选的「新增」和「更新」项会被应用；相同文章和冲突项不会改写本地草稿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有可安全解码的远端 Markdown 才能导入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only safely decoded remote Markdown can be imported"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有可安全解码的远端 Markdown 才能导入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有启用全文提取或离线缓存全文时，才会从原网站新增净化后的正文；媒体归档已停止新增，历史数据仅作兼容读取。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sanitized body content is added from the original website only when full-text extraction or offline full-text caching is enabled. New media archives are no longer created; historical data remains available for compatibility."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有启用全文提取或离线缓存全文时，才会从原网站新增净化后的正文；媒体归档已停止新增，历史数据仅作兼容读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有本地和远端都是可编辑 Markdown 时才能合并": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both local and remote versions must be editable Markdown to merge"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有本地和远端都是可编辑 Markdown 时才能合并"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有选择系统钥匙串后，AI 功能才会访问钥匙串中的 API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI features access the API key in Keychain only after System Keychain is selected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有选择系统钥匙串后，AI 功能才会访问钥匙串中的 API Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有通用草稿可以从软件资料库导出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only general drafts can be exported from the app library."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有通用草稿可以从软件资料库导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只检测本机回环地址。应用后当前连接将改为本地模式，不再要求 API Key。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only local loopback addresses are checked. Applying a result changes the current connection to local mode and removes the API key requirement."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只检测本机回环地址。应用后当前连接将改为本地模式，不再要求 API Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只清理超过期限、已读、未加入稍后阅读且没有高亮的文章。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes only articles that are older than the limit, read, not saved for later, and have no highlights."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只清理超过期限、已读、未加入稍后阅读且没有高亮的文章。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只清空已经移入资料库回收站的内容；仍在资料库中的正文和原始外部文件不会被删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only items already in the library recycle bin are removed. Content still in the library and original external files are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只清空已经移入资料库回收站的内容；仍在资料库中的正文和原始外部文件不会被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只生成脱敏副本，并清除定位、设备、作者等嵌入元数据": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create sanitized copies only and remove embedded location, device, author, and similar metadata"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只生成脱敏副本，并清除定位、设备、作者等嵌入元数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只生成脱敏副本，并清除定位、设备、作者等嵌入元数据；不会覆盖原图。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create sanitized copies and remove embedded location, device, author, and similar metadata without overwriting the originals."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只生成脱敏副本，并清除定位、设备、作者等嵌入元数据；不会覆盖原图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看未读": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unread only"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只看未读"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只读访问令牌": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read-Only Access Token"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只读访问令牌"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只配置当前路径需要的信息，之后可以随时在设置中修改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure only what this path requires. You can change these settings at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只配置当前路径需要的信息，之后可以随时在设置中修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以保留订阅并将疑似凭证值替换为 REDACTED，或整个排除这些订阅。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can keep the subscriptions and replace suspected credential values with REDACTED, or exclude those subscriptions entirely."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以保留订阅并将疑似凭证值替换为 REDACTED，或整个排除这些订阅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以先确认变化内容，再决定保存到本地或发布上线。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review the changes first, then decide whether to save locally or publish online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以先确认变化内容，再决定保存到本地或发布上线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以启动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ready to Start"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以将疑似凭证值替换为 REDACTED 后导入，或排除有风险的订阅。脱敏后需要有效凭证的订阅可能无法刷新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can replace suspected credential values with REDACTED before importing, or exclude risky subscriptions. After redaction, subscriptions that require valid credentials may fail to refresh."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以将疑似凭证值替换为 REDACTED 后导入，或排除有风险的订阅。脱敏后需要有效凭证的订阅可能无法刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以查看来源更新和历史版本；已有版本不会被静默覆盖。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review source updates and revision history; existing versions are never overwritten silently."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以查看来源更新和历史版本；已有版本不会被静默覆盖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以直接开始写作；只有选择已有连接时，才会把它关联到这个站点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
