    "将一并删除该连接档案在当前保存位置中的 API Key；其他保存位置不会被后台访问。正在被站点使用的档案不会出现在此列表中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key in the current storage location for this connection profile will also be deleted. Other storage locations are not accessed in the background. Profiles in use by a site are not listed here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将一并删除该连接档案在当前保存位置中的 API Key；其他保存位置不会被后台访问。正在被站点使用的档案不会出现在此列表中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将仅关联现有连接；凭据仍由它原有的安全存储管理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the existing connection will be linked; its credentials remain in their current secure storage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将仅关联现有连接；凭据仍由它原有的安全存储管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将从已配置的本地仓库删除 %@。该操作有路径保护和回滚，但仍需你后续检查并提交 Git 变更。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will delete %@ from the configured local repository. The operation includes path protection and rollback, but you must still review and commit the Git change."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将从已配置的本地仓库删除 %@。该操作有路径保护和回滚，但仍需你后续检查并提交 Git 变更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
