    "开启后，工作台启动、回到前台或从快速隐藏恢复时会查找当前站点仓库中的新文章。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the workbench looks for new articles in the current site's repository at launch, when returning to the foreground, and after Quick Hide ends."
          }
