    "开启后，支持的连接可以调用已勾选权限内的应用内工具；新建空白文章可直接执行，内容修改、删除、仓库写入和发布仍需单独确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, supported connections can call in-app tools covered by the selected scopes. Creating a blank article can run immediately; content changes, deletion, repository writes, and publishing still require separate confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
