    "软件会把「%@」移到回收站、%@，并清理本地 Markdown；图片资源不会自动删除。失败项会保留在发布抽屉中重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app will move “%@” to the Trash, %@, and remove its local Markdown. Image assets are not deleted automatically. Failed steps remain in the publish drawer for retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "软件会把「%@」移到回收站、%@，并清理本地 Markdown；图片资源不会自动删除。失败项会保留在发布抽屉中重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "软件会读取同步状态，不会自动修改文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app reads sync status without modifying files automatically."
          }
        },
