          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "软件会读取同步状态，不会自动修改文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "载入期间源码发生了新的编辑；为避免丢失内容，本次打开已取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The source changed while it was loading, so opening was cancelled to avoid losing edits."
