    "这两个版本没有正文或可恢复元数据差异。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These versions have no differences in body content or restorable metadata."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这两个版本没有正文或可恢复元数据差异。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些值会应用到所有文章的编辑器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These values apply to the editor for every article."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些值会应用到所有文章的编辑器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些内容来自上次异常结束前的编辑缓冲区。恢复已有草稿时，如果当前内容已经变化，会自动创建恢复副本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This content comes from the editing buffer saved before the app last exited unexpectedly. If an existing draft has changed, restoring it creates a recovery copy automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些内容来自上次异常结束前的编辑缓冲区。恢复已有草稿时，如果当前内容已经变化，会自动创建恢复副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些引用来自 Markdown 或正文 HTML；请打开对应文件修复路径。资源管理器不会自动改写文章。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These references come from Markdown or body HTML. Open the corresponding file to fix the path. The asset manager does not rewrite articles automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些引用来自 Markdown 或正文 HTML；请打开对应文件修复路径。资源管理器不会自动改写文章。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些操作只处理图片资源；点击后会先预览影响的文章和图片，不会直接改动文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These operations only process image resources. Each action previews the affected articles and images before making any file changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些操作只处理图片资源；点击后会先预览影响的文章和图片，不会直接改动文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些规则会随当前站点配置进入 AI 聊天、元数据建议、发布检查、选区编辑和图片替代文本/说明建议。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These rules follow the current site configuration into AI chat, metadata suggestions, publishing checks, selection editing, and image alt-text or caption suggestions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些规则会随当前站点配置进入 AI 聊天、元数据建议、发布检查、选区编辑和图片替代文本/说明建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些选项只作用于当前工作区；App 保持前台时会持续检查 PR/MR 是否合并，再验证对应部署。所选分钟数限制远端请求的最短间隔。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These options apply only to the current workspace. While the app remains in the foreground, it continuously checks whether the PR/MR has merged and then verifies the corresponding deployment. The selected number of minutes sets the minimum interval between remote requests."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些选项只作用于当前工作区；App 保持前台时会持续检查 PR/MR 是否合并，再验证对应部署。所选分钟数限制远端请求的最短间隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些选项只作用于当前工作区；保存、发布、切换分支或回到前台时会按需检查，所选分钟数用于限制最短重检间隔。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These options apply only to the current workspace. Checks run on demand after saves, publishes, branch switches, or returning to the foreground; the selected minutes set the minimum interval between checks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些选项只作用于当前工作区；保存、发布、切换分支或回到前台时会按需检查，所选分钟数用于限制最短重检间隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会应用上方预览的站点、发布和可选 AI 关联规则，并保存你选择的本地仓库。返回或取消不会保存这些改动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This applies the site, publishing, and optional AI connection settings shown above and saves the selected local repository. Going back or cancelling will not save these changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会应用上方预览的站点、发布和可选 AI 关联规则，并保存你选择的本地仓库。返回或取消不会保存这些改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会归档当前无法读取的数据文件，然后保存一个空白工作台。请先导出故障文件或恢复其他备份；此操作不能自动还原旧工作台。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This archives the currently unreadable data file, then saves a blank workbench. Export the faulty file or restore another backup first; this action cannot automatically restore the old workbench."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会归档当前无法读取的数据文件，然后保存一个空白工作台。请先导出故障文件或恢复其他备份；此操作不能自动还原旧工作台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会清理资料库正文、网页归档、所有版本、标注、反向链接和检索索引。磁盘上的外部原始文件不会被删除，此操作无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This permanently removes stored text, webpage archives, all versions, annotations, backlinks, and search indexes. External source files on disk are not deleted. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会清理资料库正文、网页归档、所有版本、标注、反向链接和检索索引。磁盘上的外部原始文件不会被删除，此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会退出本机当前 ChatGPT 账户；其他共用此登录的应用也可能需要重新登录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This signs out the current ChatGPT account on this Mac. Other apps that share this sign-in may need to sign in again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
