    "部署访问令牌与仓库访问令牌使用独立的钥匙串项；切换部署平台后需要保存该平台自己的令牌。旧共用令牌不会自动作为部署访问令牌使用，需要重新保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deployment and repository access tokens use separate Keychain items. After switching deployment providers, save that provider's token separately. A legacy shared token is not reused automatically as a deployment token."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
